      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "When ready to cook, thread meat onto the skewers. Tip: Fill up to 3/4 of the skewer; leaving the lower half empty so the person grilling has a \"handle\" to easily turn the satay."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "Cook on an outdoor grill, basting the first time you time it with a little of the leftover marinade from the bottom of the bowl. Turn the satay every 5 to 6 minutes until done to your liking (15 to 25 minutes)."
